===Etymology 1===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*kʷyeh₁-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|quiten}}, {{m|enm|quyten}}, from {{der|en|xno|quitter}}, {{der|en|fro|quitter}}, from {{m|fro|quitte||acquitted, quit}}, ultimately from {{der|en|la|quietus}}.

Compare {{cog|nl|kwijten||to quit}}, {{cog|nds-de|quitten||to quit}}, {{cog|de|quitten}}, {{m|de|quittieren}}, {{cog|da|kvitte}}, {{cog|sv|qvitta}}, {{m|sv|kvitta||to quit, leave, set off}}, {{cog|is|kvitta}}.

